{"school":{"dbn":"06M052","name":"Harold O. Levy School","boro":"Manhattan","district":"06","district_label":"District 6","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"Middle","grades":"6 to 8","status":"open","enrollment":131,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"650 ACADEMY STREET, MANHATTAN, NY 10034","phone":"(212) 927-7739","website":"https://www.haroldolevyschool52.com/","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/67120","accessibility":"Not Accessible","overview":"The following are some of the programs and experiences offered by the school:  STEM Electives: Robotics, Computer Science, Engineering, Graphic Design, Environment Studies & Technology \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Arts Education: Arts Horizon Programs (Theater, Dance) Tiger Marching Band, Fine Arts & Pottery \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Targeted Small Group Instruction \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Full Sized Gym with Scoreboard donated by Dyckman Basketball \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Recently Renovated Library with over $50,000 in books \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Recently Renovated Auditorium \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  New water bottle refill stations \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  New Multimillion Dollar Track & Field Renovation complete in 2024-2025 \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Regents Courses for High School Credit in Algebra & Living Environment \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Plenty of planned Field Trips that explore NYC and provided new educational experiences for students. \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Honor Roll Field trips to Broadway Shows and other exciting activities \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Monthly School Assemblies and Performances \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u0082\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u00b7  Social and Emotional Learning with Pets